      "priority": "high",
      "details": "1. Create a root layout component in `src/app/layout.tsx`.\n2. Import global CSS (including Tailwind directives) in the root layout.\n3. Define basic page structure (header, main content area, footer) within the layout.\n4. Apply initial Tailwind classes for typography, background, etc. Set up Google Fonts 'PT Serif' and 'Fira Code' using `next/font`.",
      "testStrategy": "Verify the basic layout structure appears on the home page. Check that Tailwind utility classes are being applied correctly. Verify fonts load.",
