      "priority": "high",
      "details": "1. Create the main page component at `src/app/page.tsx`.\n2. Use the content processing utilities (Task 4) to fetch sorted post data (slug, title, date, excerpt).\n3. Render a list of post previews, each linking to the post's future dynamic route.\n4. Apply Tailwind CSS for styling the list and previews.",
      "testStrategy": "Verify the home page loads and displays a list of posts fetched from the Markdown files. Check that links point to the correct slug paths (e.g., `/blog/[slug]`).",
      "subtasks": []
