      "details": "1. Create the dynamic route page component at `src/app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx`.\n2. Implement `generateStaticParams` to define all possible blog post slugs.\n3. Implement the page component to fetch full post data (including HTML content) for a given slug using Task 4 utilities.\n4. Render the post title, metadata, and HTML content using `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`. Handle image path resolution/optimization (`next/image`). Handle code blocks.\n5. \\nApply Tailwind CSS for post styling.",
      "testStrategy": "Navigate to individual blog post URLs. Verify title, metadata, and content render correctly. Ensure basic Markdown formatting (headings, lists, code blocks, images) is preserved.",
